    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Viva Veloce is a passion project dedicated to making the ultimate top-down racing experience of the street racing culture. The game takes all the great aspects of a classic top-down racing game but brings modern twists to all the mechanics from camera to opponent AI. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/1d61f980bbc7e05c12e2ab64f246b42f.poster.avif?t=1722878429\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/1d61f980bbc7e05c12e2ab64f246b42f.webm?t=1722878429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/1d61f980bbc7e05c12e2ab64f246b42f.mp4?t=1722878429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>This arcade-style game offers a huge variety of cars and modifications. Pixel art graphics meet modern lighting to create beautiful scenery. Compete in championships, tournaments, time trials, drag races, and other events to earn money. But you must tune your car to perfection to stand a chance against the best racers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/c9addabf180663b54c879b2f2d5b87e0.poster.avif?t=1722878429\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/c9addabf180663b54c879b2f2d5b87e0.webm?t=1722878429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/c9addabf180663b54c879b2f2d5b87e0.mp4?t=1722878429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>The game takes place in the capital city of Rome. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/93ae7b62c2cfa90ee5bdeed57bcc3877.avif?t=1722878429\" width=512 height=512 /></span><br><br>Play local multiplayer against your friends.",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Viva Veloce is a passion project dedicated to making the ultimate top-down racing experience of the street racing culture. The game takes all the great aspects of a classic top-down racing game but brings modern twists to all the mechanics from camera to opponent AI. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/1d61f980bbc7e05c12e2ab64f246b42f.poster.avif?t=1722878429\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/1d61f980bbc7e05c12e2ab64f246b42f.webm?t=1722878429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/1d61f980bbc7e05c12e2ab64f246b42f.mp4?t=1722878429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>This arcade-style game offers a huge variety of cars and modifications. Pixel art graphics meet modern lighting to create beautiful scenery. Compete in championships, tournaments, time trials, drag races, and other events to earn money. But you must tune your car to perfection to stand a chance against the best racers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/c9addabf180663b54c879b2f2d5b87e0.poster.avif?t=1722878429\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/c9addabf180663b54c879b2f2d5b87e0.webm?t=1722878429\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/c9addabf180663b54c879b2f2d5b87e0.mp4?t=1722878429\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>The game takes place in the capital city of Rome. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787100/extras/93ae7b62c2cfa90ee5bdeed57bcc3877.avif?t=1722878429\" width=512 height=512 /></span><br><br>Play local multiplayer against your friends.",
